  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4beb846e1faa00b4d9c5fc7e853b6151, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  startScreen: {fileID: 1588663316}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 823707175}
  button: {fileID: 110220915}
  DialogueText: {fileID: 1228470141}
  dialouge:
  - Welcome to Plunder Valley, a place filled with treasure and peril. You, lucky
    sailor, managed to find some gold, but now you must defend it from the other
    pirates in the valley.
  - To place a defense tower, click the Tower button (top right) and then drag the
    chosen cannon to the map. You may upgrade the cannon if you have enough money.
    Watch your gold closely so you don't run out too soon.
  - 'After each attack wave finishes, your fellow sailors will tell you how much
    money you have, how good your defenses are, and how much longer you need to last
    to survive the attacks. '
  - To survive each wave, keep an eye on your main tower, since that is where the
    gold is located. If the main tower reaches 0, the gold will be sunk into the
    depths of the ocean. Good luck, sailor, don't become part of Davy Jones' Locker.
  Speed: 0.04
  rawImage: {fileID: 1046882160}
  videoPlayer: {fileID: 1320959967}
  videoClips:
  - {fileID: 32900000, guid: c7c74c7c9fc7abe4d8c1f86d6e2f4bc3, type: 3}
